      "widgets_values": [
        "BAN VE TAY - SDXL + LoRA\n\nFile nay de VE THU trong giao dien. Code khong doc file nay; code doc\nsdxl_lineart.api.json. Thu trong day thay dep thi chep tham so sang ben do.\n\n=== KHAC FLUX O DAU ===\nSDXL chay CFG THAT (7.0) nen o NEGATIVE CO TAC DUNG.\nFlux schnell chay CFG=1, phan negative bi bo qua hoan toan - do la ly do\ntruoc gio phai nhet \"no gray, no shading\" vao o positive.\nO day thi khong can nua: dua het cac thu KHONG muon xuong o negative.\n\n=== NODE LoRA DANG BI TAT ===\nNode LoraLoader (mau tim) dang o che do bypass, tuc la chay thang tu\ncheckpoint sang sampler, y het nhu khong co no.\nKhi nao tai duoc LoRA line art (bo vao ComfyUI/models/loras/):\n  1. Bam vao node LoraLoader\n  2. Ctrl+B de bat lai\n  3. Chon file o o lora_name\nMuon tat lai thi Ctrl+B lan nua.\n\n=== VIET PROMPT ===\nCHU THE DUNG DAU. Day la thu quan trong nhat.\nPrompt cua Bao chay tay hoi truoc chi 27 tu va dep hon ban 163 tu cua toi -\nvi cang nhet nhieu tu phong cach len truoc thi chu the cang chim.\n\n=== DOI MOT THU MOI LAN ===\nDoi cung luc 3 tham so thi khong biet cai nao an thua.\nSeed dang de randomize. Muon so hai prompt cho cong bang thi doi seed sang\nfixed truoc da.\n\n=== CAC NUT DANG VAN DUOC ===\nsteps 28      duoi 20 net bi got. Tren 35 hau nhu khong khac.\ncfg 7.0       cao hon 9 net dam nhung hinh bat dau bien dang.\n832 x 1152    SDXL quen ~1 MP. Day len 1.5 MP tro len la net di loang choang.\n              Da thu roi va do duoc: nang do phan giai lam TE DI."
      ],
